# Force LF line endings for files the CI Linux runners execute or parse as
# shell scripts / LaTeX / reStructuredText, regardless of how they were
# edited/checked-out on Windows. CRLF in these has repeatedly broken the
# PDF build (e.g. "set -euo pipefail\r" -> "invalid option name", and image
# paths parsed with a trailing \r).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.rst text eol=lf
*.latex text eol=lf
*.tex text eol=lf
